WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.778
This briefing comes from Book 02 of
the Federal Modernization Workbook,

2
00:00:04.778 --> 00:00:09.112
Identity and Directory: the move
from Active Directory to Entra ID.

3
00:00:09.112 --> 00:00:10.888
I'll take it through four questions.

4
00:00:10.888 --> 00:00:12.587
Why identity matters now.

5
00:00:12.587 --> 00:00:15.738
What actually changes when a
directory moves to the cloud.

6
00:00:15.738 --> 00:00:17.676
Who has to own which decisions.

7
00:00:17.676 --> 00:00:20.413
And how to do it without
losing the governance that

8
00:00:20.413 --> 00:00:23.412
twenty-five years of Active
Directory quietly carried.

9
00:00:23.412 --> 00:00:26.351
The short version: this is
not a directory upgrade.

10
00:00:26.351 --> 00:00:30.020
It decides whether every
security control after it works.
